                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Much better than the steam rating suggests. This is a surprisingly polished 6v6 volleyball game with easy-to-learn controls that put the emphasis on strategy, timing and ball placement. Career mode has scouting and recruiting, and there's much more depth here than I expected. My biggest complaint is the lack of custom players and teams. Also, ball animation sometimes doesn't line up with a strikers hands.\n\nSteam Deck: Works great for me. I've played full matches, exhibition and career with no significant compatibility issues.\nNote: Deck was plugged into a dock with monitor, mouse, keyboard and a wired Turtle Beach controller. Game was played with said controller.\n\nDefinitely worth the normal price for volleyball fans. At the $1.99 sale price, it's an absolute steal.\nRecommended.",
